# --- Private: planning records and AI tooling -------------------------------
# This repo is meant to be copied to a public GitHub repo as-is. It carries code
# and the documentation the community uses; the maintainers' planning records
# and Claude configuration stay local.
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/
PLAN.md
docs/decisions/
docs/issues/
docs/deferred/
docs/user-journeys/
docs/user-journeys.md
graphify-out/

# --- Secrets ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Nothing here should ever hold a credential. Check with
# `git check-ignore -v <file>` BEFORE creating a file that will hold one.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem
credentials.json
kubeconfig
kubeconfig.*
*.kubeconfig
.dev.vars
.wrangler/

